Data

The records in this repository (raw/, state/, changes/, imports/) come from public sources and
are republished under the licence their publishers use, Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International (CC BY 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/):

- Avoimuusrekisteri (Transparency Register): Valtiontalouden tarkastusvirasto (National Audit
  Office of Finland). Attribution: "Avoimuusrekisteri, Valtiontalouden tarkastusvirasto".
- YTJ company data: Patentti- ja rekisterihallitus (PRH). Attribution: "PRH, YTJ".
- Kansalaisaloite.fi: oikeusministeriö (Ministry of Justice), under the terms of the
  kansalaisaloite.fi open data API.

Compilation and documentation

The structure of the archive, the version history, the change lists, the manifests, the
documentation and the tools in this repository are by Markus Media (https://markusmedia.fi) for
Lobbaan.fi and are licensed under CC BY 4.0. Credit: "Lobbaan.fi archive
(https://github.com/Markus-web/lobbaan-archive)" together with the original source.

The data is provided as is, without warranty. Lobbaan.fi is independent and not affiliated with
any of the publishers above.
